[82.355134, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll start by inventorying the repository, reading `info.md`, and auditing any existing GitHub workflows before making changes.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd && printf '\\n--- top-level ---\\n' && ls -la && printf '\\n--- tracked/untracked ---\\n' && git status --short --branch 2>&1 && printf '\\n--- files (depth <=3)\r\n---\\n' && find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path './.git/*' -print | sort | sed -n '1,200p'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
