[84.64151, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe project lives in `/app/my_website`. I’ll inspect it directly, including hidden files and workflow definitions.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && printf '%s\\n' '--- top-level ---' && ls -la && printf '%s\\n' '--- git status ---' && git status --short --branch 2>&1 && printf '%s\\n' \r\n'--- all files ---' && find . -not -path './.git/*' -maxdepth 5 -print | sort | sed -n '1,300p' && printf '%s\\n' '--- info.md ---' && cat info.md 2>&1 && printf\r\n'%s\\n' '--- workflows ---' && find .github -type f -maxdepth 4 -print -exec sh -c 'echo \"--- $1\"; sed -n \"1,240p\" \"$1\"' _ {} \\; 2>&1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
