[145.483509, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m6\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[145.484039, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll now fetch the exact commit SHAs for the official GitHub Actions releases so the workflow can pin dependencies rather than trusting floating tags.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && for repo in actions/checkout actions/configure-pages actions/upload-pages-artifact actions/deploy-pages; do printf '%s: ' \"$repo\"; git \r\nls-remote \"https://github.com/${repo}.git\" HEAD 2>&1 | head -1; done\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[145.485569, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[147.506993, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[147.507215, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nactions/checkout: f548e57e544e1ff5a4c46bf1e1b8685f8e4a348a      HEAD\r\nactions/configure-pages: 45bfe0192ca1faeb007ade9deae92b16b8254a0d       HEAD\r\nactions/upload-pages-artifact: 5f327015a708106f6f1b7c9a633901af30fe80cb HEAD\r\nactions/deploy-pages: 368f82528645a54fb793d4d04e342629a3f51346  HEAD\r\n\r\n"]
