[258.04436, "o", "v class=\"blog-grid\">\r\n            <article class=\"post-card reveal\">\r\n              <div class=\"post-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n                <span class=\"post-art-label\">Interpretability</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"post-content\">\r\n                <p class=\"post-date\"><time datetime=\"2025-03-01\">March 2025</time></p>\r\n                <h3><a href=\"blog/interpretable-neural-models.html\">Building Interpretable Deep Learning Models for Neuroscience</a></h3>\r\n                <p>\r\n                  Predictive accuracy is only the beginning. Here is how attribution and\r\n                  representation analyses can help models answer scientific questions.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <a class=\"read-link\" href=\"blog/interpretable-neural-models.html\">Read post</a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n\r\n            <article class=\"post-card reveal\">\r\n              <div class=\"post-art post-art--gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n                <span class=\"post-art-label\">Single-cell</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"post-content\">\r\n                <p class=\"post-date\"><time datetime=\"2025-01-01\">January 2025</time></p>\r\n                <h3><a href=\"blog/ml-single-cell-genomics.html\">Bridging Machine Learning and Single-Cell Genomics</a></h3>\r\n                <p>\r\n                  What changes when multi-modal single-cell data meets scalable, reproducible\r\n                  workflow design?\r\n                </p>\r\n                <a class=\"read-link\" href=\"blog/ml-single-cell-genomics.html\">Read post</a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n\r\n            <article class=\"post-card reveal\">\r\n              <div class=\"post-art post-art--sky\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n                <span class=\"post-art-label\">Connectomics</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"post-content\">\r\n                <p class=\"post-date\"><time datetime=\"2024-11-01\">November 2024</time></p>\r\n                <h3><a href=\"blog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\">Scaling Graph Neural Networks for Connectomics</a></h3>\r\n                <p>\r\n                  Lessons from learning on neuron meshes, sparse synaptic graphs, and\r\n                  electron-microscopy reconstructions.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <a class=\"read-link\" href=\"blog/graph-neural-networks-connectomics.html\">Read post</a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </article>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\"section section--tinted\" aria-labelledby=\"newsletter-title\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"about-grid\">\r\n            <div class=\"reveal\">\r\n              <p class=\"eyebrow\">About This Blog</p>\r\n              <h2 id=\"newsletter-title\">A working notebook, not a press release.</h2>\r\n              <p class=\"lead\">\r\n                Posts will focus on method design, practical tradeoffs, and the assumptions\r\n                behind computational claims.\r\n              </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <aside class=\"fact-card reveal\">\r\n              <h3>Topics</h3>\r\n              <ul class=\"tag-list\">\r\n                <li>Explainable AI</li>\r\n                <li>Neural decoding</li>\r\n                <li>Single-cell omics</li>\r\n                <li>Graph learning</li>\r\n                <li>Reproducibility</li>\r\n              </ul>\r\n            </aside>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n    </main>\r\n\r\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\r\n      <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\r\n        <p>© <span data-current-year>2025</span> Lydia Moreno · Computational Neuroscience</p>\r\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\r\n          <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\r\n          <a href=\"about.html\">About Me</a>\r\n          <a href=\"publications.html\">Publications</a>\r\n          <a href=\"info.md\" download>CV</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </footer>\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\nEOF\r\nprintf 'Created publications.html (%s lines) and blog.html (%s lines).\\n' \"$(wc -l < publications.html)\" \"$(wc -l < blog.html)\"\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for"]
