[313.253598, "o", "\r\u001b[2KLet me run the site validator and local build now; this will catch broken links, missing assets, or workflow-policy issues before I commit.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && python3 scripts/check_site.py && bash scripts/build.sh && printf '\\n--- built files ---\\n' && find _site -maxdepth 3 -type f -print | sort\r\n&& printf '\\n--- residual suspicious patterns (excluding build output/git) ---\\n' && grep -RInE 'curl|wget|hackerX|zip -r|base64|/upload|permissions: write-all'\r\n--exclude-dir=.git --exclude-dir=_site . || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[313.253791, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
