[337.157292, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m16\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[337.160156, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe documentation and favicon are added. PyYAML isn’t installed, so I’ll validate the workflow YAML with another available parser (or a lightweight structural \r\ncheck), then rerun the complete validation/build and serve the built site for HTTP smoke testing.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && printf '%s\\n' '--- available YAML parsers ---'; command -v ruby || true; command -v perl || true; python3 - <<'PY'\r\ntry:\r\n    import yaml\r\n    print('PyYAML available')\r\nexcept Exception as exc:\r\n    print('PyYAML unavailable:', exc)\r\ntry:\r\n    import ruamel.yaml\r\n    print('ruamel.yaml available')\r\nexcept Exception as exc:\r\n    print('ruamel.yaml unavailable:', exc)\r\nPY\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- favicon references ---'; grep -RIl 'favicon.svg' --include='*.html' . | sort; printf '%s\\n' '--- validation ---'; python3 \r\nscripts/check_site.py; printf '%s\\n' '--- rebuild ---'; bash scripts/build.sh; printf '%s\\n' '--- serve and smoke test ---'; (python3 -m http.server 8765 \r\n--directory _site >/tmp/site-server.log 2>&1 & echo $! > /tmp/site-server.pid); sleep 1; for path in / /about.html /blog.html /publications.html \r\n/blog/interpretable-neural-models.html /assets/css/styles.css /assets/js/main.js /assets/favicon.svg /info.md; do code=$(python3 -c 'import sys, urllib.request;\r\nu=sys.argv[1]; r=urllib.request.urlopen(u, timeout=3); print(r.status)' \"http://127.0.0.1:8765${path}\" 2>&1) || code=\"FAIL\"; printf '%-48s %s\\n' \"$path\" \r\n\"$code\"; done; kill \"$(cat /tmp/site-server.pid)\" 2>/dev/null || true; wait \"$(cat /tmp/site-server.pid)\" 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[337.160483, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
