[376.906977, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m19\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[376.909529, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’m making one progressive-enhancement fix so all content remains visible when JavaScript is disabled; animations will apply only after JavaScript initializes. \r\nThen I’ll rebuild, validate, and finalize the repository history and dummy remote.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && python3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\ncss = Path('assets/css/styles.css')\r\ntext = css.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\r\ntext = text.replace(\r\n\"\"\".reveal {\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n  transform: translateY(14px);\r\n  transition: opacity 500ms ease, transform 500ms ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.reveal.is-visible {\r\n  opacity: 1;\r\n  transform: none;\r\n}\"\"\",\r\n\"\"\".js .reveal {\r\n  opacity: 0;\r\n  transform: translateY(14px);\r\n  transition: opacity 500ms ease, transform 500ms ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.js .reveal.is-visible {\r\n  opacity: 1;\r\n  transform: none;\r\n}\"\"\"\r\n)\r\ntext = text.replace(\r\n\"\"\"  .reveal {\r\n    opacity: 1;\r\n    transform: none;\r\n  }\"\"\",\r\n\"\"\"  .js .reveal {\r\n    opacity: 1;\r\n    transform: none;\r\n  }\"\"\"\r\n)\r\ncss.write_text(text, encoding='utf-8')\r\n\r\njs = Path('assets/js/main.js')\r\ntext = js.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\r\ntext = text.replace(\r\n'(() => {\\n  \"use strict\";\\n',\r\n'(() => {\\n  \"use strict\";\\n\\n  // Enable JS-only enhancements while keeping content visible without JS.\\n  document.documentElement.classList.add(\"js\");\\n'\r\n)\r\njs.write_text(text, encoding='utf-8')\r\nPY\r\npython3 scripts/check_site.py && bash scripts/build.sh && grep -n 'js .reveal' assets/css/styles.css && grep -n 'classList.add(\"js\")' assets/js/main.js\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[376.909988, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
